3. Source Data (`data/`):
   - Official CPI series (`sdmx_cpi_1285.csv`, `sdmx_cpi_1286.csv`): Open public data from the
     Statistics Agency under the President of the Republic of Uzbekistan (https://siat.stat.uz).
   - World Bank L2CU v03 microdata (`UZB_2018-2025_L2CU_v03_M_CSV.zip`): NOT included in this
     repository due to World Bank Microdata Library licensing terms. Download directly from
     https://microdata.worldbank.org/index.php/catalog/6412.

